ine flour, sugar, corn meal, baking powder and salt in medium bowl and mix.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Combine milk, eggs, vegetable oil and butter in small bowl and mix well.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Add milk mixture to flour mixture and stir until smooth.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Pour into 8-inch pan.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Bake for 35 minutes or until inserted knife in center comes out clean.</li> </ol> <div class=\"ERSClear\"></div> </div> <div class=\"endeasyrecipe\" title=\"style002\" style=\"display: none\">3.5.3226</div> </div><br />\n </p>\n"
